<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Found'er Acknowledgements</title>
<style>
body { font: 14px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; max-width: 50rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
h1 { font-size: 1.8em; margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
h2 { font-size: 1.25em; margin: 2.5em 0 0.5em; }
ul.used-by { columns: 2; padding-left: 1.2em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font: 12px/1.45 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; padding: 1em; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.12); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Acknowledgements</h1>
<p>Found'er is built on the open-source software listed below. Each component is used under the license shown with it.</p>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Rust standard library</h2>
<p>Found'er includes the Rust standard library, available under the MIT License or the Apache License 2.0. Copyright The Rust Project Developers.</p>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2{{#if first_of_kind}} id="{{id}}"{{/if}}>{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="used-by">
{{#each used_by}}
{{#if (eq crate.source "registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index")}}
<li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{else if crate.repository}}
<li><a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{else}}
<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/if}}
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#unless source_path}}
<p>These components include no copy of this license; its standard text follows.</p>
{{/unless}}
{{#if (eq id "MPL-2.0")}}
<p>The unmodified source code of these components is available at the links above.</p>
{{/if}}
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
